        "Enrico Costa",
        "Filippo Frontera",
        "Shrinivas R. Kulkarni"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Afterglow localization transformed gamma-ray bursts from mysterious transients into cosmological probes.",
        "attribution": "Costa and Frontera led the instrumental discovery route, while Kulkarni made seminal optical identifications and interpretation possible.",
        "maturity": "The cosmological origin and afterglow framework have been repeatedly confirmed over decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The broader satellite and follow-up teams contributed substantially."
        ]
      }
    },
